steps.body:
In your hosting control panel open the MySQL section (cPanel: **MySQL Databases**). Create a new user with a long password, add it to the shop's database and tick only **SELECT**.

On your own server the same in SQL:

```sql
CREATE USER 'amcp_reader'@'%' IDENTIFIED BY 'a-long-password';
GRANT SELECT ON shop_database.* TO 'amcp_reader'@'%';
```
